+
+The gate applies only to preflight source/discovery. The existing runtime/image
+implementation is unchanged; its CLI adapter is not certified by these verdicts.
+No collector, C0 actor or native calibration trial ran. Changes remain local and
+uncommitted on the dependent C0-ARCH-05 branch.
+
+## Remaining C0-ARCH-05 work
+
+Following the blocked `moogle-main` discovery, the owner selected **Provide
+eligible Docker hosts**. The replacement native x64 and ARM64 SSH profiles or
+addresses have not yet been supplied.
+
+1. Select eligible native x64 and ARM64 hosts within the existing C0 contract.
+2. Independently establish daemon/kernel/namespace pairing; provision and admit
+   the pinned-SSH collector and exact images on those hosts.
+3. Review and isolate the live runtime adapter's CLI configuration/plugin and
+   subprocess-lifecycle boundaries before authorizing actor lifecycle operations.
+4. Complete closed trial dispatch, actual-end hold/aggregate-pause measurement,
+   whole-trial confinement/resource evidence and failure/cleanup handlers.
+5. Freeze and independently review the complete execution packet, then perform
+   the finite native calibration and retain all outcomes separately per platform.
+
+The host-discovery/preflight work is the first C0-ARCH-05 increment. It does not
+complete the 276-trial suite or C0-ARCH-06 accepted-image publication.
